    "module": {
      "summary": "Social Security Benefits Up-rating Order 2026 (SI 2026/148) — April 2026\nuprating of Universal Credit rates.\n\nIn the deployed DSL this would be an `amend` block against the base UC\nRegulations 2013 RuleSpec module (`tests/fixtures/rulespec/uksi/2013/376`). The Rust loader\ndoes not yet compose amendments, so the new rates are declared as\nstandalone parameters with `from 2026-04-06:` values; callers picking the\nApril 2026 version will get these figures.\n\nNotable change: LCWRA element halved to £217.26 for new claimants (a\nprotected rate of £429.80 applies to pre-2026 / terminally-ill / severe\ncases; this file uses the new-claimant figure and flags the protected\npath as out of scope)."
    },
